{"id": "text-ae5eea", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response correctly names 4-methylimidazole (4-MEI) and accurately describes it as forming during the manufacture of certain caramel colorings used in cola-flavored beverages. The caveat that the excerpt is not labeled fiscal year 2025 is extra hedging, but it is not factually wrong.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0009385600000000001, "latency_s": 1.906430500002898, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-8ee21a", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 43.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response correctly gives 43% of total consolidated assets. It also correctly states the $119 billion carrying value, both matching the reference answer.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008889000000000001, "latency_s": 1.6978432000032626, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-658abe", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 1.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response states the sales returns reserve was approximately 1.0% of annual net trade sales for fiscal 2024, which matches the reference. It does not mention that the same figure held in 2023 and 2022, but that context was not part of the question.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008355400000000001, "latency_s": 1.221391400002176, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-2eda6b", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response correctly names Costa's favorable performance in the United Kingdom as the primary driver of favorable channel mix in Global Ventures. It also correctly notes the offsetting factors, unfavorable product mix and the loss of COVID-related incentives, which matches the reference answer completely.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.00098528, "latency_s": 2.0926861000043573, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-c21c2e", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response correctly says the first fiscal quarter has historically had higher net sales. It also gives the 10-K's reason, attributing this 'in part' to seasonal holiday demand, which matches the reference answer exactly.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008541400000000001, "latency_s": 1.6511164999974426, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-20b6e4", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "abstained", "correct": false, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": null, "judge_reason": "", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": false, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.00114812, "latency_s": 3.8845741000004637, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-82a7c1", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference on both parts. It says these laws require certain data to be maintained, stored and/or processed within the country of origin. It also identifies the cost impact: maintaining local data centers in individual countries could significantly increase operating costs.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0009150800000000001, "latency_s": 1.4692002999981923, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-5ae9af", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": false, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 3, "judge_reason": "The core point matches the reference: increasing AI use in internal systems may create new attack surfaces or methods for adversaries. However, the response explicitly sets aside the 'generative AI models in our internal systems' wording, which is the FY2025 language, calling it an earlier version. It instead quotes a broader passage that likely comes from a different filing, plus an extra claim about controls not keeping pace. This misattribution undermines accuracy for the specific filing asked about.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": false, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0012615, "latency_s": 4.7321003999968525, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-1f136d", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 4, "judge_reason": "The response covers every element of the reference: customers keeping account balances, transferring money to third parties, and facilitating payments for third parties. Its framing is slightly off. It calls the account-balance and transfer points 'two reasons' and treats the payment facilitation as an add-on, when the filing presents two reasons with balances and transfers as one. The added detail on regulatory requirements (licensing, bonding, segregation of funds, etc.) matches the 10-K language and is accurate. These are minor issues.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.00095306, "latency_s": 1.745981700001721, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-889092", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference answer exactly. It says the 29% decline was driven by a lower volume of consoles sold, and it adds no incorrect claims.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008759000000000001, "latency_s": 1.2086682000008295, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-3711e8", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 165000.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference: nearly 165,000 clinical professionals out of more than 390,000 employees as of December 31, 2025. It is fully correct and complete.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008655600000000001, "latency_s": 1.1452148000062152, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-39d772", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 20.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference on every point. It gives the 20% growth figure and names increased customer usage as the primary driver. It identifies the partial offset as pricing changes primarily from long-term customer contracts.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008529, "latency_s": 1.9286339999998745, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-814331", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 11.7, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response correctly states that STELARA was about 11.7% of total revenues in fiscal 2024. It also correctly says that continued biosimilar launches in Europe and the U.S. in 2025, under patent settlement and license agreements, will affect sales. Leaving out that STELARA is the 'second largest product' is not material.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.00098024, "latency_s": 2.2223838999962027, "error": ""}
